<body><div class="lf-page"><div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 15a 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">四邊形分類＋Rhombus</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">Square·Rectangle·Rhombus·Parallelogram·Trapezoid · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info"><b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4上B冊<br/><b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span><br/><b>Prerequisites：</b>L11-L14 AreaPerimeter · SquareRectangle認識<br/><b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 掌握五種四邊形的定義和性質 ❷ 特別掌握Rhombus的獨特性質 ❸ 能分辨相似圖形<br/><b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T22 Square係咪Rhombus？· T23 Trapezoid定義搞錯 · T24 Parallelogram對邊關係混淆</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row"><span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span></div>
</div><div><div <div="" style="text-align:center;margin:12px 0;"><svg style="max-width:310px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px auto;" viewbox="0 0 310 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="20,160 200,160 230,40 50,40" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5"></polygon>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.2" x1="140.0" x2="140.0" y1="160" y2="40"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="start" x="152.0" y="100.0">4 cm</text>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="200" y1="175" y2="175"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="20" y1="170" y2="180"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="200" x2="200" y1="170" y2="180"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="110.0" y="189">6 cm</text>
</svg></div>
class="lf-h1"&gt;一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）</div>
<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>以下邊個係四邊形？A.Triangle B.Square C.Circle形 D.五邊形</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Square有幾多條邊？邊長有咩特點？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Rectangle嘅對邊有咩關係？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>一個四邊形，對邊平行但四個角唔係直角。呢個可能係咩？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Square同Rhombus有咩相同？有咩唔同？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：五種四邊形分類總覽 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <b>Square</b>：4邊等長+4個直角<br/>② <b>Rectangle</b>：對邊等長+4個直角<br/>③ <b>Rhombus</b>：4邊等長+對角相等（角唔一定係直角！）<br/>④ <b>Parallelogram</b>：2對對邊平行且等長（角可斜）<br/>⑤ <b>Trapezoid</b>：只有1對對邊平行<br/>🔑 關鍵分類法：睇邊長→睇角→睇平行邊</div></div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：Rhombus專題 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <b>Rhombus定義：</b>四條邊一樣長的四邊形（但角可斜！）<br/>② Rhombus性質：對角線互相<b>垂直平分</b>；對角線係<b>Symmetry軸</b>（2條）<br/>③ <b>Square係Rhombus嘅特殊情況</b>（四邊等長+四角=90°）<br/>④ RhombusPerimeter=邊長×4（同Square一樣！）<br/>⑤ Mnemonic：「Rhombus四邊一樣長，對角線垂直相交在中間。Square係佢進化版！」</div></div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：各圖形包含關係 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <b>包含關係（由大到小）：</b><br/>四邊形⊃Trapezoid⊃Parallelogram⊃Rectangle⊃Square<br/>四邊形⊃Trapezoid⊃Parallelogram⊃Rhombus⊃Square<br/>② <b>Square同時係：</b>Rectangle+Rhombus+Parallelogram+Trapezoid<br/>③ <b>Rectangle唔一定係Square！</b><br/>④ <b>Rhombus唔一定係Rectangle！</b></div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">判斷對錯：「所有Square都係Rhombus」呢句說話啱唔啱？解釋。</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一個四邊形有4條等長的邊，但四個角都唔係直角。呢個係咩四邊形？</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Parallelogram同Trapezoid有咩相同？有咩唔同？</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>「Square唔係Rhombus，<br/>因為Rhombus角要斜！」<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b></div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Rhombus定義=四邊等長<br/>Square四邊等長✓<br/>→Square<b>係</b>Rhombus！</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>「Trapezoid有兩對平行邊」<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b></div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Trapezoid=<b>只有一對</b>對邊平行<br/>有兩對平行邊=Parallelogram！</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>「Parallelogram對邊等長<br/>所以四條邊一樣長」<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b></div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Parallelogram=兩對對邊各自等長<br/>例如長5cm、闊3cm<br/>對邊等長但四邊唔同！</div></div><div class="warn">⚠️ Square係Rhombus嘅一種！只要四邊等長就係Rhombus，直角係bonus。</div><div class="warn">⚠️ Trapezoid定義：只有一對對邊平行。有兩對=Parallelogram≠Trapezoid。</div><div class="warn">⚠️ 所有圖形性質可以繼承：Square有齊Rhombus、Rectangle、Parallelogram、Trapezoid嘅所有性質。</div></div><div><div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div><div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共6題） Foundation Tier（All Must Complete）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>寫出以下四邊形名稱：A.四邊等長+四直角 B.對邊等長+四直角 C.四邊等長+角唔直</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>Square有幾多對平行邊？Rhombus呢？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>以下邊個係Parallelogram？A.Square B.Rhombus C.Trapezoid D.Rectangle E.以上全部</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>一個四邊形只有一對對邊平行，呢個係咩？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>Rhombus嘅四條邊有咩特點？對角線相交有咩特點？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>用間尺畫一個Rhombus（邊長4cm，角約60°和120°）。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共5題） Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>一個四邊形對邊平行且等長，四角都係直角。呢個一定係Square嗎？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>畫出一個Parallelogram（非Rhombus、非Rectangle）。標出對邊和對角。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>Rhombus對角線長6cm和8cm。對角線相交嘅點有咩特點？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>等腰Trapezoid上底4cm、下底8cm。兩條腰有咩關係？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>判斷對錯：A.所有Rectangle都係Parallelogram B.所有Rhombus都係Square C.所有Square都係Rectangle</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共5題） Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>一個四邊形對角線互相垂直平分，但四角唔係直角。呢個係咩？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>Rhombus嘅四條邊各長5cm，其中一個角係60°。求其餘三個角。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>用集合圖畫出：四邊形、Parallelogram、Rectangle、Rhombus、Square嘅包含關係。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一個四邊形同時具備：對邊平行+四邊等長+四角=90°。呢個一定係咩？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>一個RhombusPerimeter40cm。邊長=？如果佢又係Square，Area=？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🏔️ Extreme Tier（共2題） </div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>解釋：點解「所有Square都係Rhombus」但「唔係所有Rhombus都係Square」？用數學性質證明。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>一個不規則四邊形可以由對角線分成兩個Triangle。對角線長10cm，兩個Triangle高分別3cm和5cm，四邊形Area=？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）（SSPA 文字題，共 8 題）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>張枱面係Rectangle，長120cm、闊80cm。枱面係唔係Square？點解？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>風箏呈Rhombus，四邊各長45cm。風箏Perimeter係幾多？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>一塊Rhombus瓷磚對角線長30cm和40cm。可放入35cm×35cm盒嗎？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>公園用地磚（底50cm、高30cm的Parallelogram）舖滿5m×3m區域。需幾多塊？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>Trapezoid花圃上底6m、下底10m。兩腰各長5m。花圃Perimeter=？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>Square係Rhombus嗎？Rhombus係Rectangle嗎？用Venn圖解釋。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>Rhombus鏡子四邊各長25cm，其中一角70°。Area可用咩方法計？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td>圖形推理：一個四邊形對角線相等且互相平分。呢個四邊形一定係咩？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）</div><div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)（共 9 題）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>寫出Square、Rectangle、Rhombus各兩個相同點和一個不同點。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>邊句啱？A.Rhombus係Parallelogram B.Trapezoid係Parallelogram C.Rectangle唔係Parallelogram</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>畫一個Rhombus，標出四邊長度和兩條對角線。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>Square同Rhombus最大嘅分別係咩？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>一個Parallelogram，鄰邊分別長6cm和8cm。Perimeter=？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>Rhombus對角線互相垂直，Square有冇？Rectangle有冇？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>一個四邊形對邊平行，四邊等長。可以推斷係咩圖形？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>等腰Trapezoid上底5cm、下底11cm、高4cm。Area可用咩公式？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H9</td><td>畫出四邊形嘅家族樹，由最基礎到最特殊排列。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)（共 5 題 🚀）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H10</td><td>Parallelogram對角線互相平分但不相等且不垂直。呢個係咩特定圖形？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H11</td><td>Rhombus對角線長12cm和16cm，求RhombusArea。（對角線乘積÷2）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H12</td><td>解釋：點解Square可以同時滿足Rectangle、Rhombus、Parallelogram、Trapezoid嘅所有定義？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H13</td><td>一個四邊形對角線相等、互相平分、且垂直。呢個四邊形係咩？證明。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H14</td><td>兩個相同Rhombus（邊長5cm，銳角60°）拼在一起，可拼出咩圖形？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div><div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div></div>
<table class="et"><tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td><b>Square係唔係Rhombus？</b></td><td>係！Rhombus定義=四邊等長。Square四邊等長=符合。Square係「直角Rhombus」。</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><b>Trapezoid定義混亂</b></td><td>Trapezoid=只有一對對邊平行。有兩對=Parallelogram。等腰Trapezoid：兩腰等長。</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><b>Parallelogram對邊關係</b></td><td>對邊係不相鄰嘅兩條邊。Parallelogram：兩組對邊各自平行且等長。鄰邊可以唔同長！</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><b>Rhombus同Square嘅分別</b></td><td>兩者都係四邊等長。分別：Square必須有4個直角；Rhombus角可以斜。Square⊂Rhombus。</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><b>Rectangle同Square嘅分別</b></td><td>兩者都有4個直角。分別：Square要四邊等長；Rectangle只需對邊等長。Square⊂Rectangle。</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><b>對角線性質記錯</b></td><td>Square：對角線相等+垂直平分。Rhombus：對角線垂直平分（不一定相等）。Rectangle：對角線相等（不一定垂直）。</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><b>圖形層級關係混淆</b></td><td>Square⊂Rhombus∩Rectangle⊂Parallelogram⊂Trapezoid⊂四邊形。背熟呢個層級關係！</td></tr></table><div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「Square最全能四邊等長兼直角，Rhombus四邊等長但角可斜，長方對邊等長四直角，平行四邊兩對平行邊，Trapezoid只有一對平行線。層級關係記心間！」</div><div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving （5 min）</div><div class="sc"><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">睇邊長</div><div class="sdetail">四邊等長？（Square/Rhombus）定對邊等長？（Rectangle/Parallelogram）</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">睇角</div><div class="sdetail">四個直角？（Square/Rectangle）定角可斜？（Rhombus/Parallelogram）</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">睇平行</div><div class="sdetail">有幾多對平行邊？兩對（Parallelogram）定一對（Trapezoid）？</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">定結論</div><div class="sdetail">綜合判斷：邊+角+平行→鎖定圖形。再檢驗性質是否符合。</div></div></div>
